  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "  <size=125%><b>Game Guide</b></size>\n\n  <size=100%><b>Game Description</b></size>\n 
    You will play as a brave princess on a journey to save the\n  kingdom. Legend
    has it that mysterious gems scattered\n  across different regions hold powerful
    energy. Only by\n  collecting them and surviving each trial can the darkness\n 
    threatening the kingdom be lifted.\n\n  Along the way, you will encounter different
    enemy types\n  with their own behaviours and combat styles.\n  Collect coins
    across the map to unlock stronger attack\n  abilities, gather the required gems,
    and complete each\n  level\u2019s challenge to finally save the kingdom.\n\n 
    <size=100%><b>Controls</b></size>\n  <b>W</b> Move Forward / <b>S</b> Move Backward\n 
    <b>A D</b> Turn Left / Right\n  <b>Shift</b> Run\n  <b>Space</b> Jump\n  <b>Hold
    Right Mouse Button</b> Rotate camera\n  <b>Left Mouse Button</b> Attack\n  <b>1
    2 3</b> Switch attack modes\n\n  <size=100%><b>Combat</b></size>\n  <b>Attack
    1</b>: Basic attack (low damage)\n  <b>Attack 2</b>: Unlockable (medium damage)\n 
    <b>Attack 3</b>: Unlockable (high damage)\n\n  <b>Dog</b>: Fast melee chaser\n 
    <b>Lich</b>: Patrols and guards important items\n  <b>Wizard</b>: Stronger enemy
    that enters a second phase\n  when health is low\n\n  Use movement and positioning
    to avoid continuous\n  damage.\n\n  <size=100%><b>Collection & Progression</b></size>\n 
    Collect coins placed in the level to unlock stronger attack\n  abilities.\n 
    Green items restore health.\n  Each level requires collecting a specific number
    of gems.\n  Reach the exit after completing the objective.\n\n  <size=100%><b>Level
    Objectives</b></size>\n  <b>Level 1</b>: Collect 2 gems within 40 seconds\n 
    <b>Level 2</b>: Collect 2 gems within 60 seconds\n  <b>Level 3</b>: Collect 3
    gems within 90 seconds\n\n  Later levels contain stronger enemies and higher\n 
    pressure.\n\n  <size=100%><b>Victory & Defeat</b></size>\n  Health reaches 0
    -> Defeat\n  Time reaches 0 -> Defeat\n  Collect all required gems and reach
    the goal -> Victory\n  Completing Level 3 -> The kingdom is saved\n\n  <size=100%><b>Tips</b></size>\n 
    Use running and movement to avoid enemy attacks.\n  Prioritize collecting coins
    to unlock stronger attacks.\n  Watch the countdown timer in each level.\n  Be
    careful when the wizard enters its second combat\n  phase.\n  Use the mini-map
    to track direction and objectives\n  (mouse wheel to zoom in/out).\n  Adjust
    music and sound via the button in the bottom-left\n  corner.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
